text:
@dylanpynk.bsky.social - thank you so much for sharing your art and your talents with the world! I can’t wait to hang this canvas piece in my art room and wear this “A.I. Sux” t-shirt all over the place. Keep up your awesomeness!! 💙

(Get your own here: dylanpynk.printify.me )

#gayart #queerart
